# Rust desktop build artifacts (13GB+ — never part of any image)
apps/desktop/target

# EXP-375: build-time licence data (~7 MB of inventory JSON). The image needs
# packages/licenses/package.json — `bun install --frozen-lockfile` validates the
# whole workspace set — but never the inventories or the reproduced texts. The
# notice the app actually serves is apps/web/public/NOTICES.txt, already built
# into .output/public.
packages/licenses/inventory
packages/licenses/texts
